Stale index: deletions must propagate too" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#5F667A;fontSize=8.5;fontFamily=Helvetica" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="468" width="496" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b-46" value="Measure the halves separately: &lt;b&gt;recall@k&lt;/b&gt; for retrieval (was the right chunk in the top &lt;i&gt;k&lt;/i&gt;?), then groundedness and citation accuracy for generation." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E9FBF0;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0A4A25;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="508" width="772" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b-47" value="The frontend owes the user three things a demo skips: the sources, visible and clickable; citations that hydrate rather than jump as tokens stream; and a designed &amp;quot;I could not find this&amp;quot; state — because a refusal is a success, and without a place to put it the model invents instead." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF6E7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#6B3A05;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="548" width="772" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>